    {
        "Id": 13,
        "ActionId": 13,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Roland",
            "Hold on... You're not really trying to kill me, now, are you?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 14,
        "ActionId": 14,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "...Hmph.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 15,
        "ActionId": 15,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Seeing that Gabriel has withdrawn his hostility, Roland becomes his usual self once again, standing up and wiping off the dirt on his shoulder nonchalantly."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "You're too stiff for the ladies, you know? And I don't mean it as a compliment.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "Not my concern.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 18,
        "ActionId": 18,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Not even when it's our dear Miss Luna?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 19,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Frankly, you really should take a lesson on the art of conversation. Even the Babylonians can't resist when I turn up the charm—they always listen to everything I have to say.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 20,
        "ActionId": 20,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Wield it properly, and your tongue can be plenty mighty.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 21,
        "ActionId": 21,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "Excuses for the incompetent. You never were familiar with the concept of humility.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "I'm flattered.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 23,
        "ActionId": 23,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 24,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "To tell you the truth, I always take you as quite an eccentric individual, but I'm not even remotely close, am I?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 25,
        "ActionId": 25,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "...When an agent of the Ascension-Network goes astray, it is our duty as an Ascendant to correct them.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 26,
        "ActionId": 26,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Words of a trusted advisor. Luna must be pleased to know how loyal you are to the Ascnet.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 27,
        "ActionId": 27,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "That said, she never does anything without her reasons. Have you thought about the consequences of questioning her?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 28,
        "ActionId": 28,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "Have you?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 29,
        "ActionId": 29,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "I believe in Luna.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 30,
        "ActionId": 30,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "Believe, or fear?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 31,
        "ActionId": 31,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            4
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 32,
        "ActionId": 32,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 33,
        "ActionId": 33,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "Where were you after what happened in Asslam and Venus Splash Park?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 34,
        "ActionId": 34,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Searching for new \"preys,\" as usual. Obviously.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 35,
        "ActionId": 35,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "And to quell a bit of my curiosity along the way.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "Does that include operating without Miss Luna's authorization?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "...Oops.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "I know you are hiding something, Roland. You cannot conceal it even if you try.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 40,
        "ActionId": 40,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "...Fine.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 41,
        "ActionId": 41,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Roland takes out an old hard drive from his windbreaker and throws it toward Gabriel. It glides in a slight arc before Gabriel snaps it out of the air."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 42,
        "ActionId": 42,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Watch it! I didn't make backups.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 43,
        "ActionId": 43,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "What is in it?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 44,
        "ActionId": 44,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Nothing of significance, compared to all the researches done by Shome.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 45,
        "ActionId": 45,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "But... it's better than nothing.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 46,
        "ActionId": 46,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            4
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 47,
        "ActionId": 47,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Luna didn't seem very pleased with Shome's results. I wanted to find out what she's really after.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 48,
        "ActionId": 48,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "And if what she's seeking contradicts the ideals of the Ascension-Network...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 49,
        "ActionId": 49,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Roland quiets down. Having heard what he said, Gabriel turns to stare at him, the uncomfortable silence between them spreading and festering."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 50,
        "ActionId": 50,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Eventually, Roland shrugs."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 51,
        "ActionId": 51,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "By the way, what are you planning to do with the Core we got?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 52,
        "ActionId": 52,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "I have my plans.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 53,
        "ActionId": 53,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "...Follow me, if you want to know.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 54,
        "ActionId": 600,
        "Type": 202,
        "Params": [
            2,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 55,
        "ActionId": 54,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "With that, Gabriel turns around and departs, leaving Roland behind. Roland tracks Gabriel's silhouette with his eyes, his signature smile receded."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 56,
        "ActionId": 55,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "AniZhuanchangBegin",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Well... Fun's over.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 57,
        "ActionId": 56,
        "Type": 202,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "",
