    {
        "Id": 60,
        "ActionId": 59,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "AniZhuanchangEnd",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The red mud enveloping the Hetero-Core stirs and brews, reaching out and touching Gabriel's feet as he walks past, acting chaotic yet docile."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 61,
        "ActionId": 60,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "In this pool of blood-red mess, something begins to emerge, then crumples, before reforging itself into a new form."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 62,
        "ActionId": 61,
        "Type": 201,
        "Params": [
            1,
            500008,
            4,
            -400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 63,
        "ActionId": 62,
        "Type": 201,
        "Params": [
            2,
            500101,
            "",
            400
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 64,
        "ActionId": 63,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Roland",
            "...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 65,
        "ActionId": 64,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Looking good, not bad.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 66,
        "ActionId": 65,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "So what's the difference between this fella and your little pets? It keeps reshaping itself.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 67,
        "ActionId": 66,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "The Hetero-Core you asked about is inside there. Unlike the inferior Rail Heterozygote, this will evolve into the most advanced being that the Punishing Virus has ever touched.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 68,
        "ActionId": 800,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "What you are seeing is it searching for its most efficient, potent form. Only through destruction can it be reborn into a superior vessel.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 69,
        "ActionId": 67,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "Just like... Miss Luna.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 70,
        "ActionId": 68,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "Oh, how our grand vision has come to an impasse.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 71,
        "ActionId": 69,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "You are right about one thing. Miss Luna has not been acting like herself lately.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 72,
        "ActionId": 70,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "She has become content with the status quo. That is not the behavior of a respectable agent of the Ascension-Network.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 73,
        "ActionId": 71,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "To Ascendants, staying put is no different from regression. A sure path to self-annihilation.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 74,
        "ActionId": 72,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "Which is why we require a motivator, something to rekindle her appreciation of her grand mission.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 75,
        "ActionId": 73,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "With this?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 76,
        "ActionId": 74,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "The strength I have been seeking, the most pure form of power, might just lie within.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 77,
        "ActionId": 75,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "Perhaps if I follow this path, it will not be long before I come across the answer I am looking for. And then...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 78,
        "ActionId": 76,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Gabriel does not continue his speech. His eyes fixate on the \"creature\" in front of him, repeating the cycle of decimation and rebirth."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 79,
        "ActionId": 77,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            4
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 80,
        "ActionId": 78,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Out of curiosity, does Alpha know what you're doing?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 81,
        "ActionId": 79,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "She will when the time is right. Now is not it.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 82,
        "ActionId": 80,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "Her perspective is still too shallow, having yet to understand what the Ascension-Network truly means. Miss Luna has never imparted those lessons.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 83,
        "ActionId": 81,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "It's her long-lost sister, after all. Offering connections instead of burdens sounds like what Luna would do.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 84,
        "ActionId": 82,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "But if such pointless sentiments have wavered her will as an agent, she will require correction.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 85,
        "ActionId": 83,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "There is no price I would not pay for the future of the Ascension-Network.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 86,
        "ActionId": 84,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 87,
        "ActionId": 85,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 88,
        "ActionId": 86,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "What a sight to see you agitated.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 89,
        "ActionId": 87,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Gabriel",
            "For the Ascension-Network.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 90,
        "ActionId": 88,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Fine, then. I'll take care of Alpha, and you do what you have to do.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 91,
        "ActionId": 89,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Hopefully... it all goes according to plan.",
            1
        ]
    },
