    {
        "Id": 100,
        "ActionId": 98,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Lee",
            "We can now be certain that the \"Red Tide\" is connected to the Ascendants. The way they exploited the Hetero-Core...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 101,
        "ActionId": 99,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "The Hetero-Creatures must also be their works.",
            100
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 102,
        "ActionId": 100,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liv",
            "I have analyzed the data from our battles and found biological traits in all our enemies. From their looks to their behaviors, it is as if... they were mimicking the evolution of early earthborn creatures.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 103,
        "ActionId": 101,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Liv",
            "If we consider the \"Red Tide\" as the ocean of a young Earth, the Hetero-Creatures would be the growing species in the sea.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 104,
        "ActionId": 102,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lee",
            "While we can't confirm the exact time when the tide and the creatures came into existence, it's apparent that it must be after the Hetero-Core fell.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 105,
        "ActionId": 103,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Lee",
            "The rate they're evolving... If it isn't their creator's intent but their own volition, then they will be far worse enemies than the Corrupted.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 106,
        "ActionId": 104,
        "Type": 202,
        "Params": [
            1,
            2,
            "",
            "",
            "",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 107,
        "ActionId": 105,
